WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.960
I'm the last car humans drove on the Moon.

2
00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:12.510
I lost a fender and Gene fixed it with duct tape and folded maps.

3
00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:22.630
Harrison — the only geologist to walk on the Moon — found orange soil near me. My camera filmed their liftoff.

4
00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:26.590
I've been waiting for company ever since.

5
00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:32.310
The last car on the Moon, parked right where its drivers left it.
